Average customer: 40,000 ₽/mo, lifetime 26 months → 1,040,000 ₽ over their lifetime.

Variable costs: infrastructure 3,000 ₽/mo, support 4,000 ₽/mo, implementation 60,000 ₽ one-time.

CAC: 180,000 ₽ (sales, two-month deal cycle).

Average customer contribution: about 798,000 ₽, payback period 5.5 months.

By segment:
— distributors with 15–40 employees (31 customers): support 1,500 ₽/mo, contribution 900,000 ₽;
— medium (68 customers): contribution about 780,000 ₽;
— retail chains (12 customers): support 21,000 ₽/mo plus custom development, negative contribution;
— manufacturing (9 customers): lifetime 5 months, CAC is never recovered.

Out of 41 new customers this year, 14 are retail chains and manufacturing companies.
